Version: 1.7.1
Date: 2026-11-19
+ Support MGnifyR 1.99.0 (MGnify API v2): addMGnify matches samples by
"sample_accession" by default, and documentation uses MGnifyR::fetchAnalyses
+ Add isHoloFoodAvailable() to check whether the HoloFood server responds.
Examples, tests and the vignette are skipped if the server is down, and
transient server errors are retried.

